--- a bytes body is framed by Content-Length, in one write
writes -> 1
--- 200 with a text body
    b'HTTP/1.1 200 OK'
    b'content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8'
    b'content-length: 6'
    b'date: <clock>'
    b''
    b'hello\n'
--- a Reader body is framed by chunked
head, one chunk, terminator -> 3
--- 200 with a streamed body
    b'HTTP/1.1 200 OK'
    b'content-type: application/octet-stream'
    b'transfer-encoding: chunked'
    b'date: <clock>'
    b''
    b'8'
    b'streamed'
    b'0'
    b''
    b''
--- HEAD carries the framing and no body
writes -> 1
--- HEAD response
    b'HTTP/1.1 200 OK'
    b'content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8'
    b'content-length: 6'
    b'date: <clock>'
    b''
    b''
--- 204 carries no framing at all
--- 204 response
    b'HTTP/1.1 204 No Content'
    b'date: <clock>'
    b''
    b''
--- a connection that will not be reused says so
--- 200 with Connection: close
    b'HTTP/1.1 200 OK'
    b'content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8'
    b'content-length: 4'
    b'connection: close'
    b'date: <clock>'
    b''
    b'bye\n'
--- json_response
--- 200 with a JSON body
    b'HTTP/1.1 200 OK'
    b'content-type: application/json'
    b'content-length: 17'
    b'date: <clock>'
    b''
    b'{"ok":true,"n":2}'
--- a caller-set Date is left alone
date -> Sun, 06 Nov 1994 08:49:37 GMT
--- HTTP/1.0 has no chunked coding, so an unsized body is delimited by the close
no transfer-encoding header -> -
--- 1.0 response with an unsized body
    b'HTTP/1.1 200 OK'
    b'connection: close'
    b'date: <clock>'
    b''
    b'raw bytes'
--- a header cannot end the header block early
ValueError: illegal character in response header value for 'x-echo'
--- reason phrases
200 -> OK
404 -> Not Found
431 -> Request Header Fields Too Large
599 -> Unknown
--- IMF-fixdate
the epoch -> Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT
RFC 9110's own example -> Sun, 06 Nov 1994 08:49:37 GMT
a leap day -> Tue, 29 Feb 2000 00:00:00 GMT
the last second of 1999 -> Fri, 31 Dec 1999 23:59:59 GMT
2038, past a 32-bit second count -> Tue, 19 Jan 2038 03:14:08 GMT
before the epoch -> Wed, 31 Dec 1969 00:00:00 GMT
